{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3496890/extras/fe7826e0be79aa3ad7234823a8001e30.poster.avif?t=1773674040\" width=874 height=272 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3496890/extras/fe7826e0be79aa3ad7234823a8001e30.webm?t=1773674040\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3496890/extras/fe7826e0be79aa3ad7234823a8001e30.mp4?t=1773674040\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3496890/extras/9c10b71f3b1bbf35bcef1ee96bb4ed0c.avif?t=1773674040\" width=375 height=92 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;<strong>Slot or not</strong>&quot; is a <strong>deck-building turn-based </strong>slot machine battling adventure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take on the role of a nimble hare -\u00a0<strong>Bun Dorian</strong>, accompanied by a fighting slot machine called <strong>Slottie</strong>, who is trying to save his native village from the invasion of <strong>crazy fruits</strong> that have started to appear in the neighborhood.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The adventure will give you <strong>unforgettable emotions</strong> and <strong>fun</strong>. And <strong>no</strong> <strong>gambling</strong> at all.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3496890/extras/863b4c81d1ee1edc00844505376ecb75.poster.avif?t=1773674040\" width=616 height=190 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3496890/extras